<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερτομ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taunt, sneer at</i>, c.acc.pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή μιν κερτομέωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.87
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.350
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				986
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1293
			</span></i>: abs., <i>sneer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τις . . κερτομέοι ἐπέεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατθανοῦσι κ. ἐπ᾽ ἀνδράσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					64
				</span></i>
			: freq. in part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί με
				ταῦτα κελεύετε κερτομέοντες</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.153
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὲ δὲ κερτομέουσαν ὀΐω ταῦτ᾽
					ἀγορευέμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.326
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότερα δὴ κερτομῶν λέγεις
				τάδε</span>; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1235
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραιβόλα κερτομέουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					56
				</span></i>
			: c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐῶ σε κ. ἡμᾶς τόδ᾽ αὖθις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					619
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ τί τυ κερτομέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					1.62
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβουλος ὣς κεκερτομημένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					321
				</span></i>
			.—Rare in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.656
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
